From 117f2908e9b8a00c91ad05cea345917075968fe3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: luannt <luannt.devops@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:40:14 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] docs: match README, guide, changelog and help to the V3
 candidate

An independent read against the code found sentences the merged POCs made
wrong or contradictory: --yolo for run/send/loop and the refusal when it
differs (with Home/agent-cli-tmux as the case that cannot match), server
shutdown (cancel and record, unless a workspace takes over 15 s), which
model `run -m` changes in local mode, the new eval scripts, nested
`!agent-cli run` env, the stale-server path that only tcp --host can still
reach, help text of send (ack after the prompt is recorded) and loop
(trusted keys from the original env), and the remaining MCP limits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
